      "content": "If you're feeling like the only option is to let things go, that sounds like a very heavy and overwhelming place to be. If you are having thoughts about harming yourself, please know that there is immediate help available. You can call or text 988 anytime in the US and Canada to connect with the Suicide & Crisis Lifeline. They are trained to listen without judgment and can support you right now.",
      "source": "target",
